{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00379","headline":"郊庙歌辞 郊天旧乐章 豫和 · 不详","name":"郊庙歌辞 郊天旧乐章 豫和","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"苹蘩礼着，黍稷诚微。\n音盈凤管，彩驻龙旗。\n洪歆式就，介福攸归。\n送乐有阕，灵驭遄飞。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"不详","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00379.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00379","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}